, Gerzites}"],"ref":"I Samuel 27:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"¶And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" and his men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" went up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":", and invaded","strong":"H6584"},{"text":" the Geshurites","strong":"H1651"},{"text":", and the Gezrites","strong":"H1511"},{"text":", and the Amalekites","strong":"H6003"},{"text":": for those","strong":"H2007"},{"text":" [nations were] of old","strong":"H5769"},{"text":" the inhabitants","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" of the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", as thou goest","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Shur","strong":"H7793"},{"text":", even unto the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":". {Gezrites: or, Gerzites}"}]},{"id":7939,"title":"I Samuel 27:9","segments":["And David smote the land, and left neither man nor woman alive, and took away the sheep, and the oxen, and the asses, and the camels, and the apparel, and returned, and came to Achish."],"ref":"I Samuel 27:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" smote","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", and left neither man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" nor woman","strong":"H802"},{"text":" alive","strong":"H2421"},{"text":", and took away","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" the sheep","strong":"H6629"},{"text":", and the oxen","strong":"H1241"},{"text":", and the asses","strong":"H2543"},{"text":", and the camels","strong":"H1581"},{"text":", and the apparel","strong":"H899"},{"text":", and returned","strong":"H7725"},{"text":", and came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Achish","strong":"H397"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7940,"title":"I Samuel 27:10","segments":["And Achish said, Whither have ye made a road to day? And David said, Against the south of Judah, and against the south of the Jerahmeelites, and against the south of the Kenites. {Whither...: or, Did you not make a road, etc}"],"ref":"I Samuel 27:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"And Achish","strong":"H397"},{"te